#: ../../cli.md:1
msgid "命令行工具 sapicli"
msgstr "sapicli command line tool"

#: ../../cli.md:3
msgid ""
"`sapicli` 是独立的 Go 程序（仓库 [sapicd/cli](https://github.com/sapicd/cli)），不依赖 "
"Python 环境，官方发布 Windows / macOS / Linux 三端压缩包，解压即用，功能覆盖上传、相册、有效期、 "
"输出风格与剪贴板复制。"
msgstr ""
"`sapicli` is a standalone Go program "
"([sapicd/cli](https://github.com/sapicd/cli)) that needs no Python "
"environment. Official builds are published as archives for Windows / macOS "
"/ Linux and run as soon as you unpack them, covering uploads, albums, "
"expiry, output styles and clipboard copying."

#: ../../cli.md:8
msgid ""
"`sapicli` 是**独立项目**，当前发布版仍按 v1 接口设计：`-u` 会自动补 `/api/upload`，`-t` 传的是 v1 的 "
"LinkToken，因此在 v2 站点上**用不了**。支持 v2 的版本发布后，只需把 `-u` 指向站点根地址、 `-t` 换成 "
"PAT，参数与输出风格不变。在那之前请用[快捷上传](usage.md)里的 curl / PicGo 方案。"
msgstr ""
"`sapicli` is a **separate project** and the current release still targets "
"the v1 API: `-u` appends `/api/upload` automatically and `-t` takes a v1 "
"LinkToken, so it **does not work** against a v2 site. Once a v2-capable "
"release ships you only point `-u` at the site root and pass a PAT to `-t`; "
"arguments and output stay the same. Until then use the curl / PicGo recipes"
" in [Quick upload](usage.md)."

#: ../../cli.md:13
msgid "功能"
msgstr "Features"

#: ../../cli.md:15
msgid "批量上传任意数量图片，支持匿名上传与临时图片（有效期）"
msgstr ""
"Upload any number of images in one go, including anonymous uploads and "
"temporary images (expiry)"

#: ../../cli.md:16
msgid "设置相册、标题/描述"
msgstr "Set the album, title and description"

#: ../../cli.md:17
msgid "多种输出风格：`default`、`typora`、`line`、`empty` 与自定义模块"
msgstr ""
"Several output styles: `default`, `typora`, `line`, `empty` and custom "
"modules"

#: ../../cli.md:18
msgid "上传结果跨平台复制到剪贴板，支持 URL / Markdown / rST 三种格式"
msgstr "Copy results to the clipboard on any platform as URL / Markdown / rST"

#: ../../cli.md:20
msgid "安装"
msgstr "Install"

#: ../../cli.md:22
msgid ""
"到 [cli release](https://github.com/sapicd/cli/releases) 下载对应压缩包：Windows 选 "
"`xxx-windows-amd64.zip`，macOS 选 `xxx-darwin-amd64.tar.gz`。压缩包里只有一个可执行文件， 放进"
" `PATH` 里的目录，或直接用绝对路径调用。"
msgstr ""
"Download the archive for your platform from the [cli "
"releases](https://github.com/sapicd/cli/releases): `xxx-windows-amd64.zip` "
"for Windows, `xxx-darwin-amd64.tar.gz` for macOS. The archive holds a "
"single executable — put it in a directory on `PATH`, or call it by absolute"
" path."

#: ../../cli.md:26
msgid "macOS 也可以用 Homebrew 安装："
msgstr "On macOS you can also install it with Homebrew:"

#: ../../cli.md:33
msgid "命令选项"
msgstr "Options"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "选项"
msgstr "Option"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "说明"
msgstr "Description"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "`-u`"
msgstr "`-u`"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "站点地址，可省略 `http://`，末尾的接口路径也会自动补齐；也可用环境变量 `sapicli_apiurl`"
msgstr ""
"Site address; `http://` may be omitted and the API path is appended "
"automatically. Also available as the `sapicli_apiurl` environment variable"

