msgid "`-t`"
msgstr "`-t`"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "访问令牌，需要上传权限；也可用环境变量 `sapicli_apitoken`"
msgstr ""
"Access token with upload permission. Also available as the "
"`sapicli_apitoken` environment variable"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "`-a`"
msgstr "`-a`"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "相册名，可覆盖令牌默认相册"
msgstr "Album name; overrides the album fixed on the token"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "`-d`"
msgstr "`-d`"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "图片标题（描述）"
msgstr "Image title (description)"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "`-e`"
msgstr "`-e`"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "有效期（秒），用于临时图片"
msgstr "Expiry in seconds, for temporary images"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "`-s`"
msgstr "`-s`"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "输出风格，见下"
msgstr "Output style, see below"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "`-c`"
msgstr "`-c`"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "上传后按 `url` / `md` / `rst` 复制到剪贴板"
msgstr "Copy the result to the clipboard as `url` / `md` / `rst`"

#: ../../cli.md:73
msgid "**输出风格**："
msgstr "**Output styles**:"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "风格"
msgstr "Style"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "行为"
msgstr "Behaviour"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "`default`"
msgstr "`default`"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "打印完整的 JSON 上传结果（含失败项）"
msgstr "Print the full JSON upload result (failures included)"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "`typora`"
msgstr "`typora`"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "专给 Typora 的格式，只输出成功上传的图片地址"
msgstr "Format for Typora: only the URLs of successful uploads"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "`line`"
msgstr "`line`"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "与 `typora` 类似，但不打印提示文字，每行一个地址"
msgstr "Like `typora` but without any hint text: one URL per line"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "`empty`"
msgstr "`empty`"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "不输出内容"
msgstr "Print nothing"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "`<模块名>`"
msgstr "`<module name>`"

#: ../../cli.md:7
msgid "自定义输出：sapicli 用 `python -m <模块名>` 调用它，result 以 JSON 从位置参数传入"
msgstr ""
"Custom output: sapicli calls it with `python -m <module>` and passes the "
"result as JSON in a positional argument"

#: ../../cli.md:83
msgid "自定义输出的模块示例："
msgstr "Example custom output module:"

#: ../../cli.md:95
msgid ""
"**剪贴板复制**：`-c url` 复制裸地址，`-c md` 复制 `![1.png](http://cdn.com/1.png)`， `-c "
"rst` 复制 reST 的 `.. image::` 形式；多个文件的结果用换行连接。Windows 用 `clip`， macOS 用 "
"`pbcopy`，Linux 需要先装 `xclip`（仅桌面环境）。"
msgstr ""
"**Clipboard**: `-c url` copies the bare URL, `-c md` copies "
"`![1.png](http://cdn.com/1.png)` and `-c rst` copies the reST `.. image::` "
"form; results for several files are joined with newlines. Windows uses "
"`clip`, macOS uses `pbcopy`, and Linux needs `xclip` installed (desktop "
"only)."

#: ../../cli.md:100
msgid "上传的文件要放在**所有选项之后**，否则选项会被当成文件名。"
msgstr ""
"Files must come **after all options**, otherwise an option is taken as a "
"filename."

#: ../../cli.md:103
msgid "示例"
msgstr "Examples"

#: ../../cli.md:116
msgid "作为 Typora 上传服务"
msgstr "Use as the Typora upload service"

#: ../../cli.md:118
msgid "Typora → **偏好设置 → 图像**：插入图片时选「上传图片」，上传服务选 **Custom Command**， 命令填："
msgstr ""
"Typora → **Preferences → Image**: choose to upload images on insert, pick "
"**Custom Command** as the upload service and enter:"

#: ../../cli.md:125
msgid "点「验证图片上传选项」确认可用。不想依赖 CLI 时，也可以用[快捷上传](usage.md)里的 `curl` 脚本，效果一致。"
msgstr ""
"Click the upload-verification button to confirm. If you prefer not to "
"depend on the CLI, the `curl` script in [Quick upload](usage.md) does the "
"same job."

#: ../../cli.md:128
msgid "右键菜单"
msgstr "Context menu"

#: ../../cli.md:130
msgid ""
"Windows 与 macOS 的右键上传菜单（含 sapicli 与免安装的 `.cmd` 脚本两种方式）统一整理在 "
"[快捷上传](usage.md)的「Windows 右键菜单」「macOS 右键菜单」两节，这里不再重复。"
msgstr ""
"The Windows and macOS right-click upload menus (both the sapicli route and "
"the dependency-free `.cmd` script) live in the Windows context menu and "
"macOS context menu sections of [Quick upload](usage.md) and are not "
"repeated here."

